WEBVTT

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:33.851
Step 2: Hope that malarial fevers 
clear the syphilis.

00:00:33.851 --> 00:00:38.141
And step 3: Administer quinine 
to curb the malaria.

00:00:38.141 --> 00:00:40.101
If all went according to plan,

00:00:40.101 --> 00:00:44.390
their patient would be left alive 
and free of both diseases.

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:49.594
This killed some 15% of patients, 
but for those who survived,

00:00:49.594 --> 00:00:51.254
it seemed to work.

00:00:51.254 --> 00:00:54.130
It actually became the standard treatment 
for syphilis

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:57.878
until penicillin 
was widely used decades later.

00:00:57.878 --> 00:01:01.428
And its driving force was fever.